  "description": "Tidal pairs two slides with a long climbing run, so children always have a choice of what to do next. A pink wavy slide and a blue spiral slide come off the main tower, while climbing panels and a wavy net climber stretch out to one side. Moulded snail, bird and flower toppers sit on the posts. The structure takes 30 to 35 children and covers 30'6\" x 21'7\", with a safe play area of 36'6\" x 27'7\". That long shape fits along the edge of a society lawn or a school ground. Its listed skills are confidence, strength, leadership and self control. Tidal comes in mixed colours as part of our NexLev Escapade series. Galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope on Tidal are covered by a 3-year warranty. Send us the length of your site and we will see if it fits.",
